 793:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  *                   Range: [0x0 to 0x3]
 794:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * @return <BR>
