1183:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * Enables the trap feature, by setting CC4yTC.TRAPE0, CC4yTC.TRAPE1, CC4yTC.TRAPE2 and CC4yTC.TRAP
