1435:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * Retrieves the timer period value currently effective, by reading CC4yPR register.\n\n
1436:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * If the timer is active then the value being returned is currently being used for the PWM period.
