1441:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * is enabled and if a period match occurs. Hence a consecutive call to XMC_CCU4_SLICE_GetTimerPeri
1442:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_ccu4.h ****  * would not reflect the new values until the shadow transfer completes.
